WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:05.890
Speaker 1: So listen, there is an investigation
into Joe Biden's son, Hunter Biden, that is

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:12.280
reportedly going on, and I really want to
speak to either the progressives in the audience

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:17.590
in the sense that for months, really almost
four years now, the right and Republicans

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.619
and the Trumpian right has been talking about
Hunter Biden's laptop, Hunter Biden's laptop,

00:00:22.619 --> 00:00:27.750
Hunter Biden's criminality, Joe Biden's criminality
linked to Hunter Biden.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:32.301
And we have taken each story one at a time
and each claim one at a time and said, Here

00:00:32.301 --> 00:00:34.960
is the lies here is the lies, here is the
lies.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:42.339
I've also said before that if Hunter Biden
maybe did something wrong, he should be investigated.

00:00:42.339 --> 00:00:47.579
And unlike Donald Trump, Joe Biden shouldn't
try to interfere with that investigation.

00:00:47.579 --> 00:00:53.649
Joe Biden shouldn't try to affect or influence
that investigation in any way.

00:00:53.649 --> 00:00:59.059
And if Hunter Biden has committed a crime,
he should be charged, and if he is convicted,

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:00.319
he should be punished.

00:01:00.319 --> 00:01:05.199
This is a very different perspective than
that of the Trumpian right, which is obfuscate,

00:01:05.199 --> 00:01:09.990
obstruct, influence and try to affect legal
proceedings.

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:14.670
So we should be consistent, and that's exactly
what I'm going to be.

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:18.650
First of all, I'm not going to hide from you
that it now appears there is a federal investigation

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:20.250
into Hunter Biden.

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:25.360
Big report yesterday from CNN Federal investigation
of Hunter Biden heats up now it has nothing

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:29.910
to do with the laptop may be disappointing
to some Republicans in our audience.

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:30.950
CNN reports.

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:36.020
A Justice Department investigation into Hunter
Biden's business activities has gained steam

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:40.840
in recent months, with a flurry of witnesses
providing testimony to federal investigators

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:44.430
and more expected to provide interviews in
the coming weeks.

00:01:44.430 --> 00:01:47.080
According to multiple sources familiar with
the matter.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:51.800
OK, what are the origins or oranges of this
investigation?

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:56.930
Well, the probe, led by the U.S. attorney
in Wilmington, Delaware, began as early as

00:01:56.930 --> 00:02:03.710
2018, and it concerns multiple financial and
business activities in foreign countries dating

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:07.480
to when Joe Biden was vice president.

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:11.239
Investigators have examined whether Hunter
Biden and some of his associates associates

00:02:11.239 --> 00:02:17.120
violated money laundering, tax and foreign
lobbying laws, as well as firearm and other

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:18.489
regulations.

00:02:18.489 --> 00:02:22.060
These are that's a serious investigation.

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:26.120
Hunter Biden has not been charged with any
crimes, has denied wrongdoing.

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:31.769
His father, President Joe Biden, is not being
investigated as part of the probe of his son's

00:02:31.769 --> 00:02:36.090
business activities, according to sources
who have been briefed.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:41.779
But the ongoing investigation has persistently
raised questions about the ethics and behavior

00:02:41.779 --> 00:02:46.230
of the president's son and has fueled right
wing political attacks.

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:51.900
In 2019, then President Trump pressured Ukraine
to investigate the Bidens over Hunter's work

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:58.279
for Burisma, a Ukrainian energy company, eventually
leading to Trump's first impeachment.

00:02:58.279 --> 00:02:59.590
So.

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:02.610
Guys, let's just allow this to happen.

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:05.279
Right, I mean, investigate.

00:03:05.279 --> 00:03:07.169
Do whatever you need to do.

00:03:07.169 --> 00:03:12.060
I don't care about Hunter Biden as in terms
of, you know, as a political program in terms

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:13.920
of political analysis.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:20.791
Unlike Jared Kushner, unlike Ivanka Trump,
unlike so many of Trump's cronies, Hunter

00:03:20.791 --> 00:03:23.560
has nothing to do with Joe Biden's administration.

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:25.669
Hunter has nothing to do with policy.

00:03:25.669 --> 00:03:30.469
Hunter's not sitting in for the secretary
of state the way Ivanka was at the G20 or

00:03:30.469 --> 00:03:31.889
whatever meeting it was.

00:03:31.889 --> 00:03:34.180
I have no interest in defending Hunter Biden.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:37.700
There is nothing linking Joe Biden to any
of this.

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:41.980
Hunter Biden is being investigated for things
he did as a private citizen.

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:44.590
If he did something wrong, then charge the
guy.

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:47.290
If you want to throw the book at him, throw
the book at him.

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:52.879
If he's found guilty of any crimes, we shouldn't
apply a different standard now at the same

00:03:52.879 --> 00:03:53.879
time.

00:03:53.879 --> 00:04:01.029
It's worth remembering that what's going on
with Hunter Biden reinforces that what appears

00:04:01.029 --> 00:04:08.790
to be the Trump crime family should be investigated,
and we continue to wonder what's going on,

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:09.790
what's going on.

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:13.760
Manhattan investigators quitting because they
got the impression that even though they found

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:19.570
evidence of Trump felonies, not Trump's kids
Trump felonies, that no charges were forthcoming.

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:26.010
I told you on Monday or Tuesday that a federal
judge has indicated evidence should be provided

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:30.150
on the basis that it seems likely that Trump
committed felonies.

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:33.660
Merrick Garland seems to have absolutely no
interest in pursuing any of it.

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:36.900
So investigate Hunter, investigate Trump.

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:38.400
There's evidence of felonies.

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:39.400
Charge all of them.

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:41.910
Here's a quick report from CBS News about
this.

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:46.390
Speaker 2: Multiple sources tell CBS News
that the federal investigation into Hunter

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:49.220
Biden's business practices is broader than
previously known.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:55.570
The probe is exploring whether the younger
Biden and his associates violated tax money

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:58.290
laundering and foreign lobbying laws.

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:02.880
Business records reviewed by CBS News and
documents released by Republicans in Congress

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:08.720
indicate multiple financial transactions involving
Hunter Biden, his firm and a Chinese energy

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:10.870
company called CFC.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:14.640
Republicans allege the company is an arm of
the Chinese government.

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:16.070
Speaker 1: Investigate all of it.

00:05:16.070 --> 00:05:17.650
So let's be consistent, guys.

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:18.980
Let's be consistent.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:23.710
Everybody who has who is suspected of wrongdoing
should be investigated.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.490
If he's cleared, he will be cleared.

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:27.340
If he's not, he can be charged.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:28.340
That's it.

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:35.980
And we need to remember when we talk about
the laptop claims and Rudy Giuliani's evidence

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.930
that he has in his den or whatever.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:40.650
When it's wacky and cartoonish, we debunk
it.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:44.980
Separately, there's an investigation going
on and it should and nobody should interfere

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:45.980
in it.

